gineering and the Zelman Center for Brain Science Research"}}]},{"typeName":"studyType","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["experimental"]},{"typeName":"dsDescription","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"The BGU Pattern-Cutting Dataset (BGU-PatCut) contains the raw data for the publication \"Augmenting Robot-Assisted Pattern Cutting with Periodic Perturbations – Can We Make Dry Lab Training More Realistic?\"\n<br>\nThe dataset comprises data from 54 participants who performed 24 repetitions of a robot-assisted pattern-cutting surgical task under various conditions. For each repetition, we share kinematic data, video recordings, and manual labels for the different stages of the task. Detailed information on data collection is available in the Methods section of the manuscript.\n<br>\nThe dataset includes a PDF file describing the data and separate folders for each experiment:<br>\n1.\tPatternCuttingForcePerturbation \n<br>\n2.\tPatternCuttingMotionPerturbations\n<br> \nWe recommend using the \"Tree\" view instead of the \"Table\" view to view the files organized by folder."}}]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Surgical Skill Acquisition"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Sensorimotor Adaptation"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Human-Robot Interaction"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Surgical Robotics"}}]},{"typeName":"language","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["English"]},{"typeName":"depositor","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Sharon, Yarden"},{"typeName":"dateOfDeposit","